---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/nine-hypotheses-westrum-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/nine-hypotheses-westrum-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Leadership expected a bureaucratic culture; the survey measured a generative one"
  caption="Six-item Westrum instrument on a 5-point scale. The generative band starts at 3.5."
>
  A one to five scale for the Westrum culture mean. Leadership expected about 2.5. The survey came back at 3.82, inside the generative band, which runs from 3.5 to 5.
</Chart>
